    "10 semanas alternando umbral e intervalos, con larga progresiva hasta 16 km y taper de 2 semanas. Cierra con un 10K a fondo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 weeks alternating threshold and intervals, with a long run progressing to 16 km and a 2-week taper. It closes with a 10K race."
          }
        }
      }
    },
