    "12 semanas con umbral y bloques al ritmo objetivo de media desde la semana 6, larga hasta 20 km con dos descargas y taper de 2 semanas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12 weeks with threshold and half-marathon goal-pace blocks from week 6, a long run up to 20 km with two down weeks and a 2-week taper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 semanas: larga progresiva hasta 18 km con descargas, umbral semanal desde la semana 3 y taper de 2 semanas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12 weeks: a long run progressing to 18 km with down weeks, weekly threshold from week 3 and a 2-week taper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "120": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "120"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14 semanas de alta especificidad: dos sesiones de calidad por semana, rodaje medio, larga hasta 22 km y taper de 2 semanas. Pide base real.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14 weeks of high specificity: two quality sessions a week, a medium-long run, a long run up to 22 km and a 2-week taper. It needs a real base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "16 semanas: larga hasta 30 km (o 3 h, lo que llegue primero) con descargas cada 4ª semana, rodaje medio de mitad de semana, umbral semanal, finales a ritmo de maratón desde la semana 9 y taper de 3 semanas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "16 weeks: a long run up to 30 km (or 3 h, whichever comes first) with a down week every 4th week, a midweek medium-long run, weekly threshold, marathon-pace finishes from week 9 and a 3-week taper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "18 semanas de máxima especificidad: dos calidades por semana, bloques largos a ritmo de maratón, rodaje medio, larga hasta 32 km (o 3:30, lo que llegue primero) y taper de 3 semanas. Pide base real y sin molestias.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "18 weeks of maximum specificity: two quality sessions a week, long marathon-pace blocks, a medium-long run, a long run up to 32 km (or 3:30, whichever comes first) and a 3-week taper. It needs a real base and no niggles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "18 semanas: larga hasta 32 km (o 3:15, lo que llegue primero) con finales a ritmo de maratón cada vez más largos desde la semana 7, rodaje medio de mitad de semana, umbral semanal, tres descargas y taper de 3 semanas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "18 weeks: a long run up to 32 km (or 3:15, whichever comes first) with progressively longer marathon-pace finishes from week 7, a midweek medium-long run, weekly threshold, three down weeks and a 3-week taper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
