    },
    "Este plan necesita al menos %lld días por semana y no vamos a comprimirlo en menos: la tirada larga pasaría a dominar la semana y dejaría de ser ese plan. Tu disponibilidad queda como la declaraste — podés sumar días, mover la fecha o elegir otro objetivo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This plan needs at least %lld days per week and we're not going to squeeze it into fewer: the long run would take over the week and it would stop being that plan. Your availability stays as you declared it — you can add days, move the date or pick another goal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Este plan necesita al menos %lld días por semana.": {
